# Project Rules

## Non-negotiable

1. Read memory before any edit (see `memory-session.mdc`)
2. Never repeat known errors — check `03-ERRORS/error-memory.md` first
3. Never expose secrets in any file
4. Confirm before: `rm`, `DROP TABLE`, force push, hard reset, migrations
5. Verify before "done" — tests pass + typecheck clean

## Code quality

- Follow existing naming, error handling, and async patterns
- Prefer small targeted changes over large rewrites
- Update docs when behavior or CLI changes
- Record assumptions; they may be wrong and block others

## Completion gate

Do not say "done" until:
- [ ] Files match intent
- [ ] Typecheck clean (state result)
- [ ] Tests pass on touched areas (state result)
- [ ] Session digest written
- [ ] session-continuity.md overwritten
- [ ] No secrets written

Full rules: `AGENTS.md`
